{"seq":1,"slug":"cross-warehouse-supply-pool","title":"跨仓多节点库存可见性与供给池建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/inventory-supply-availability/cross-warehouse-supply-pool","wordCount":3061,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨仓多节点库存可见性与供给池建模\">跨仓多节点库存可见性与供给池建模</h1><p>一个买家在欧洲站下单，商品此刻实际躺在三个地方：德国自营仓 80 件、波兰 3PL 仓 210 件、还有 400 件正从亚洲在途、预计 12 天到港。承诺引擎只看见德国仓的 80 件时，会拒掉一个本可从波兰发货的订单；把这 690 件当成一个数字全部可售时，又会对一个只能德国发货的买家谎报有货，最终超卖。同一个「有货没有」的问题在跨仓场景下变成三个必须先拆开的问题：节点在哪里、每个节点还剩多少、这些节点对某个买家是否真的可达。本文处理这条从物理库存到「可承诺供给池」的建模链路。同章目录见 <a href=\"./\">本册索引</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>库存节点（inventory node）</strong> 是能独立持有并发出库存的最小物理或逻辑单元：自营履约中心、3PL 仓、门店后仓、代发供应商，甚至一个在途批次都可建模为节点；<strong>库存网络（inventory network）</strong> 是这些节点及其调拨边的集合；<strong>供给池（supply pool）</strong> 是按业务规则聚合出的逻辑可售单元，承诺引擎只对池计算可承诺量。</p>\n<p>供给池建模的核心不是「把数字加起来」，而是决定三件事：<strong>哪些节点可合并成一个池</strong>（共享规则）、<strong>合并后的池对某个需求点是否可达</strong>（可达性）、<strong>每个节点贡献的净数量是多少</strong>（净额）。任一缺失都会造成两个方向的错误——不可达库存算进来是虚假承诺（超卖），可达库存漏掉是虚假缺货（漏单）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[物理库存事件&lt;br/&gt;收货/拣货/盘点/报废] --&gt; B[节点库存账本]&#10;    B --&gt; C{节点可见性校验}&#10;    C --&gt;|新鲜度不足| D[降级为不可承诺]&#10;    C --&gt;|通过| E[净可承诺量 NetATP_i]&#10;    F[在途批次] --&gt; E&#10;    G[预留与冻结&lt;br/&gt;软预留/硬预留/风控] --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; H[供给池聚合规则]&#10;    H --&gt; I[区域池 / 全局池 / 虚拟池]&#10;    I --&gt; J[承诺引擎查询入口]\">graph TD\n    A[物理库存事件&lt;br/&gt;收货/拣货/盘点/报废] --&gt; B[节点库存账本]\n    B --&gt; C{节点可见性校验}\n    C --&gt;|新鲜度不足| D[降级为不可承诺]\n    C --&gt;|通过| E[净可承诺量 NetATP_i]\n    F[在途批次] --&gt; E\n    G[预留与冻结&lt;br/&gt;软预留/硬预留/风控] --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; H[供给池聚合规则]\n    H --&gt; I[区域池 / 全局池 / 虚拟池]\n    I --&gt; J[承诺引擎查询入口]</pre><p>节点数据的形态决定了它能否直接进池，四类输入的「可用」含义完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据形态</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>进池前的必要处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>节点物理库存</td>\n<td>WMS 实时账本</td>\n<td>在库位上、可拣</td>\n<td>扣减已分配未发货、破损与锁定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在途库存</td>\n<td>采购单 / 调拨单 / ASN</td>\n<td>已发出但未收货</td>\n<td>按预计到货日与履约时效判断可用性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道分配库存</td>\n<td>电商平台后台</td>\n<td>已按渠道切分的可售量</td>\n<td>识别是否被平台独占，避免重复可售</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商可承诺量</td>\n<td>供应商接口 / VMI</td>\n<td>未持有但可采购的供给</td>\n<td>需并入采购提前期，不参与即时承诺</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>物理库存的可用是时间点概念，在途库存是时间区间概念，渠道分配库存带有排他约束，供应商可承诺量依赖补货提前期；混进一个 <code>available</code> 字段，就等于提前丢掉了承诺引擎的约束信息。节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的净可承诺量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>NetATP</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mtext>OnHand</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>Allocated</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>Reserved</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>SafetyStock</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>InboundUsable</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NetATP}_i \\;=\\; \\text{OnHand}_i - \\text{Allocated}_i - \\text{Reserved}_i - \\text{SafetyStock}_i + \\text{InboundUsable}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NetATP</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OnHand</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Allocated</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Reserved</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SafetyStock</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">InboundUsable</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>InboundUsable</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{InboundUsable}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">InboundUsable</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只有在到货日落在承诺时效窗口内才非零，因此同一批在途库存对「次日达」与「两周内送达」是两个完全不同的数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"库存节点的类型与可见性分级\">库存节点的类型与可见性分级</h2><p>不同节点的可信度差别巨大：自营仓账本是第一手事实，3PL 仓账本依赖对方定时回传，代发供应商的「有货」可能只是一句口头承诺。平等对待它们是跨仓引擎最常见的超卖来源。成熟做法是给每个节点（或其数据源）赋予一个<strong>可见性等级</strong>，等级决定该节点的库存能参与哪一类承诺。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可见性等级</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>典型滞后</th>\n<th>可支持的承诺类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0 原始事件</td>\n<td>拣货机/扫码枪事件流</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>仅用于事后对账，不进承诺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1 节点物理账</td>\n<td>自营 WMS 事务账本</td>\n<td>秒-分钟级</td>\n<td>可即时承诺（同区发货）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 校验后可用量</td>\n<td>扣减预留后的净额</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>可承诺，可参与区域池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 池化可售量</td>\n<td>聚合 + 调拨成本</td>\n<td>分钟-小时级</td>\n<td>可承诺，附带跨仓调拨时效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 成本优化可售</td>\n<td>加入履约成本择优</td>\n<td>小时-天级</td>\n<td>用于定价与最优节点选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分级把「新鲜度」这一抽象质量要求落成可配置参数。节点同步滞后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>lag</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{lag}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lag</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超出承诺窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>promise</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{promise}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时该节点必须降级——把不可控的数据延迟转化成可控的承诺保守性。常见阈值：窗口小于 2 小时只信 L1，2-24 小时信 L2，跨日承诺才允许 L3 池化结果参与。</p>\n<p>可达性同样必须显式建模。同一个欧洲池里的德国仓与波兰仓，对德国买家的可达性并不相同——波兰仓发货意味着多 1-2 天跨境时效与更高单件运费。因此池的定义不是「地理相邻」，而是<strong>在给定承诺时效与成本约束下可互相替代的节点集合</strong>；买家请求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mtext>地区</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>承诺时效</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>商品</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle \\text{地区}, \\text{承诺时效}, \\text{商品} \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">地区</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">承诺时效</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">商品</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 必须先按可达性过滤节点再累加净额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"供给池的聚合策略与净可承诺量计算\">供给池的聚合策略与净可承诺量计算</h2><p>聚合粒度直接决定库存利用率与超卖风险之间的平衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>聚合策略</th>\n<th>合并范围</th>\n<th>利用率</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单节点池</td>\n<td>每个仓独立可售</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>时效极严、跨境成本极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域池</td>\n<td>同区域/同国家仓合并</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>主流跨境平台默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局池</td>\n<td>所有节点合并</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>单一市场、低运费敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟池（调拨替代）</td>\n<td>节点 + 可调拨关系</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>有成熟调拨网络时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>区域池之所以成为多数跨境平台的默认，是因为它在「把库存当共享资源」和「不承诺做不到的时效」间取得了平衡。全局池的诱惑最大但代价也最大：它把每个节点都当成可服务任何买家，实际把履约风险全部转移到下单后的调拨环节。</p>\n<p>聚合还有一个必须处理的细节：<strong>同一批库存不能同时进入多个池</strong>。多平台、多渠道销售时，若商品在主站、某第三方平台、线下门店同时挂售，把同一件可售库存分别计入三个池就是三倍的超卖敞口。正确做法是引入<strong>分配账本（allocation ledger）</strong>，把库存按渠道切分为互斥配额，未切分的部分留在共享池。这是「跨仓」之外的另一条正交约束：跨仓解决空间上的节点，分配账本解决渠道上的独占。</p>\n<p>承诺引擎的一次查询可固定为一条确定性流水线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[买家请求: 地区+时效+SKU+数量] --&gt; B[解析可达节点集合]&#10;    B --&gt; C[逐节点取 NetATP_i]&#10;    C --&gt; D{新鲜度与等级达标?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[该节点剔除]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[累加池内净额]&#10;    F --&gt; G[扣减渠道配额占用]&#10;    G --&gt; H{池内合计 &gt;= 需求量?}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[返回缺货或降级到更长时效池]&#10;    H --&gt;|是| J[生成软预留 + 返回承诺交期]\">flowchart TD\n    A[买家请求: 地区+时效+SKU+数量] --&gt; B[解析可达节点集合]\n    B --&gt; C[逐节点取 NetATP_i]\n    C --&gt; D{新鲜度与等级达标?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[该节点剔除]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[累加池内净额]\n    F --&gt; G[扣减渠道配额占用]\n    G --&gt; H{池内合计 &gt;= 需求量?}\n    H --&gt;|否| I[返回缺货或降级到更长时效池]\n    H --&gt;|是| J[生成软预留 + 返回承诺交期]</pre><p>顺序（先可达性、再净额、最后配额）不能随意调换：先累加再过滤可达性会把不可达库存算进去；先算配额再算净额，会在节点实际缺货时错误地认为配额已满足。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在途-预留与跨节点库存共享\">在途、预留与跨节点库存共享</h2><p><strong>在途库存</strong>的本质是一个带时间戳的承诺：只有到货日 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 上架时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span> 承诺交付日、且该批次未被采购或调拨需求占用时，才对某次查询可用。第二个条件常被忽略——同一批在途货既被当补货来源又被当可承诺供给，重复计算就是超卖的隐形来源。</p>\n<p><strong>预留（reservation）</strong> 分软硬两种语义。软预留是询问阶段的临时占用，允许过期自动释放，用于买家填写地址、选择支付方式期间锁住供给；硬预留是订单确认后的强占用，直到发货或取消才释放：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>NetATP</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mtext>OnHand</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>HardReserved</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>SoftReserved</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>SafetyStock</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>InboundUsable</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NetATP}_i \\;=\\; \\text{OnHand}_i - \\text{HardReserved}_i - \\text{SoftReserved}_i - \\text{SafetyStock}_i + \\text{InboundUsable}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NetATP</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OnHand</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HardReserved</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SoftReserved</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SafetyStock</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">InboundUsable</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SoftReserved</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SoftReserved}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SoftReserved</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须在聚合时按过期时间滚动清理，否则被弃单占用的库存会长期挂在账上，形成「账面有货、实际卖不出」的僵尸库存。预留要做成带 TTL 的幂等操作，键通常由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mtext>订单号</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>SKU</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>节点</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle \\text{订单号}, \\text{SKU}, \\text{节点} \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">订单号</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SKU</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">节点</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 组成。</p>\n<p><strong>跨节点共享</strong>的高级形态是虚拟池加调拨网络：允许承诺来自一个需要 1-2 天调拨的邻近节点，显著提高利用率，但前提是<strong>调拨成功率作为独立指标监控</strong>。失败率上升（承运商爆仓、清关延误）时虚拟池会系统性违约，引擎必须自动收缩池的可达范围。</p>\n<p>安全库存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SafetyStock</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{\\text{SafetyStock}}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SafetyStock</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是净额公式里唯一由策略而非事实决定的项，按服务水平反推：给定需求标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与补货提前期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mi>L</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z \\cdot \\sigma_d \\cdot \\sqrt{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1133em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 取服务水平对应的正态分位数（95% 约 1.65）。它让可承诺量对真实需求<strong>可持续</strong>——把所有库存都承诺出去，等于打光补货周期的缓冲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"节点数据质量与校准\">节点数据质量与校准</h2><p>跨仓引擎长期稳定的关键不在算法，而在<strong>对每个节点的持续校准</strong>。节点数据质量会随时间漂移：3PL 回传延迟上升、盘点误差累积、在途批次延误、供应商虚报可售量；累积几百笔后就会以「明明有货却发不出」的形式集中爆发。工程上给每个节点维护一组质量指标并绑定动作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>恶化时的动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同步滞后</td>\n<td>上次账本更新时间距今</td>\n<td>超阈值则降级可见性等级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账实差异率</td>\n<td>系统账 vs 实盘差异</td>\n<td>超阈值则整体打折可承诺量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变化率</td>\n<td>单位时间库存变动幅度</td>\n<td>异常跳变标记为待核验，暂不承诺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预留冲突率</td>\n<td>并发预留失败比例</td>\n<td>上升则加强锁粒度或降低池共享度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调拨达成率</td>\n<td>虚拟池调拨按期完成比例</td>\n<td>下降则收缩虚拟池可达范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>校准上有一条常被低估的原则：<strong>宁可少承诺，不可乱承诺</strong>。节点数据不新鲜时，正确动作是把该节点暂时移出池，而不是用旧数据算一个可能偏高的数：少承诺一次只损失一个订单的机会成本，多承诺一次要付出退款、赔付与平台指标惩罚。可落地的自愈流程是：节点异常 → 降级可见性等级 → 复用上一可用快照并加保守系数 → 触发重新对账盘点 → 差异收敛后自动恢复等级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>跨仓供给池建模的核心，是把分散、异步、可信度不一的物理事实收敛成一个承诺引擎可放心查询的逻辑池。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>节点数据按<strong>物理库存、在途、渠道分配、供应商可承诺量</strong>四类分开处理，绝不合并成一个 <code>available</code> 字段。</li>\n<li>每个节点需要<strong>可见性等级</strong>与<strong>同步滞后</strong>，等级决定它能参与哪类承诺，滞后超窗口即降级。</li>\n<li>净可承诺量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>NetATP</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>OnHand</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>Allocated</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>Reserved</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>SafetyStock</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>InboundUsable</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NetATP}_i = \\text{OnHand} - \\text{Allocated} - \\text{Reserved} - \\text{SafetyStock} + \\text{InboundUsable}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NetATP</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OnHand</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Allocated</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Reserved</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SafetyStock</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">InboundUsable</span></span></span></span></span></span>，预留分软硬、在途带到货日与占用校验。</li>\n<li>聚合粒度（单节点 / 区域 / 全局 / 虚拟）是利用率与超卖风险的显式权衡，跨境场景多数落在区域池。</li>\n<li>跨渠道时，互斥的<strong>分配账本</strong>是防止同一批库存被多池重复可售的必要约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一节讨论交期承诺：供给池只回答「有多少、在哪里、是否可达」，交期承诺要回答「哪一天能到、能不能更快」——本文定义的节点等级与可达性是它避免对慢节点做出快承诺的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考资料\">参考资料</h2><ul>\n<li>多级库存与安全库存理论：Silver, Pyke, Peterson《Inventory Management and Production Planning and Scheduling》。</li>\n<li>ATP/CTP 标准术语：APICS/ASCM《Supply Chain Operations Reference (SCOR)》。</li>\n<li>分布式订单管理节点信用与库存池化：Manhattan Associates、Blue Yonder 公开产品文档。</li>\n<li>云侧库存口径：Shopify Inventory API 多 location 与 <code>available</code> 语义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨仓多节点库存可见性与供给池建模","id":"跨仓多节点库存可见性与供给池建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"库存节点的类型与可见性分级","id":"库存节点的类型与可见性分级"},{"level":2,"text":"供给池的聚合策略与净可承诺量计算","id":"供给池的聚合策略与净可承诺量计算"},{"level":2,"text":"在途、预留与跨节点库存共享","id":"在途-预留与跨节点库存共享"},{"level":2,"text":"节点数据质量与校准","id":"节点数据质量与校准"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"参考资料","id":"参考资料"}],"prev":{"title":"可承诺量分配与优先级策略（客户分层、渠道权重与抢占）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/atp-ctp-promise-model/promise-allocation-priority-policy"},"next":{"title":"净可承诺量计算：预留、安全库存、在途与退货入库扣减","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/inventory-supply-availability/net-available-quantity-computation"}}